abstract: >-
  Termux App Store is a TUI and CLI package manager built natively for
  Termux on Android. It installs community packages as pre-built .deb files
  that are verified against a per-architecture SHA256 checksum, falls back to
  building from a package build.sh recipe when no verified binary is
  available, and also publishes a signed APT repository. It needs no root
  access, no account and sends no telemetry.
keywords:
  - termux
  - android
  - package-manager
  - tui
  - cli
